@startuml Sequence Diagram - Criação de Registro Médico
actor Médico
participant NotesService
participant AppointmentsService
participant NotesDB

Médico -> NotesService: POST /records (dados registro)
NotesService -> AppointmentsService: GET /appointments/{id} (valida consulta)
AppointmentsService --> NotesService: Retorna dados consulta
NotesService -> NotesDB: Salva AppointmentRecord
NotesService --> Médico: Retorna sucesso
@enduml
